         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Arthrospira (Spirulina) platensis supplementation affects folliculogenesis, progesterone and ghrelin levels in fattening pre-pubertal gilts</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
